abstract: >-
  A WRRA dual-component model that decomposes observed gravity into direct
  baryonic mass gravity and an additional component associated with stress
  stored in spatial twist and deformation. The model connects cosmological
  inputs to the galactic low-acceleration scale and states explicit
  cross-scale falsification conditions.
